  1565                              <1> 
  1566                              <1> ; nxl: step EDI over one line, to just past its LF (and return not-zero),
  1567                              <1> ; or stop at the NUL that ends the text (and return zero).
  1568                              <1> nxl:    mov     al,[edi]
